  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Prevenci&#xf3;n y atenci&#xf3;n al embarazo y la fecundidad adolescente en Cuba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Prevenci&#xf3;n y atenci&#xf3;n al embarazo y la fecundidad adolescente en Cuba - The Multiannual Indicative Programme (MIP) for Cuba 2021-2027 foresees a first financial envelope of EUR 91 million in two focal sectors: i) Ecological transition: Sustainable municipalities; ii) Modernisation of the economy: maximising the potential of all economic actors in key sectors. Within the MIP, a total of EUR 5 million is set aside for Support Measures, including measures in favour of civil society and the cooperation facility.</narrative>
  </description>
